# field-orders: battlefield orders given the way retail takes them (an LMB with a selection, running), authored over rhbot from
# boot in the Skirmish mode. Equal battle, A Bridge Too Far: box-select the archers (paused), run, LMB an empty hex (move
# order FUN_0043c634, its marker 0x4be33f), LMB the minimap (march order via FUN_00432443), LMB enemy units with archers /
# crossbows / knights / melee selected (targeted missile fire 0x479e90 → 0x48143b), LMB a selected unit's portrait (drops it,
# 0x43c4c6); the siege-defender button, Mop up, Autocalc → ratings → setup. Siege, Castle Acre as the attacker, Cust.:
# no archers / peasants, 2 catapults, 3 towers, 2 rams, Go from the custom page: catapults → the palisade ring (siege fire,
# order 12 → wall breach), rams → the gate (order 14), towers → beside the wall (docked), swords / pikes → the moat (order
# 9, filling); the camera follows the works; the siege-defender button, Mop up, Autocalc → ratings → setup.
